irm area abutting ink C D  superior margin of biopsy cavity  lateral to medial E  deep margin of biopsy cavity  lateral F  firm breast parenchyma inferior to biopsy cavity G  nipple  Resident  Joseph Misdraji  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART   LEFT SIMPLE MASTECTOMY   report_end  , Positive.
